      "id": "s02-carrier",
      "intent": "The carrier equation separates dense feature creation from token-preserving window partitioning.",
      "claim": "\\mathbf{F}=\\mathcal{E}(\\mathbf{I}_{\\mathrm{LR}}),\\qquad \\mathbf{X}=\\mathcal{W}(\\mathbf{F})",
      "narration": "The encoder maps the low-resolution image into a dense feature field. That field is the carrier the compact thought process can read and update. The window partition forms tokens from the field while preserving them for the next stage.",
